WEBVTT

00:00:00.144 --> 00:00:03.304
I'm making Kaoru into the queen?
What are you saying?!

00:00:07.384 --> 00:00:09.114
Kaoru! Are you okay?

00:00:09.984 --> 00:00:11.974
She's fine, just unconscious.

00:00:12.284 --> 00:00:13.684
Thank goodness.

00:00:13.684 --> 00:00:16.124
Aoi, Hyobu's still over there, right?

00:00:16.494 --> 00:00:19.294
Yeah. He's real, not an illusion.

00:00:19.294 --> 00:00:20.524
Shiho?

00:00:22.664 --> 00:00:25.134
We can take our time discussing it later, Hyobu.

00:00:25.134 --> 00:00:28.124
But for now... Once I arrest you,
my duty is complete!

00:00:35.244 --> 00:00:36.774
This is a doll.

00:00:36.774 --> 00:00:39.334
It's made of some sort of carbon
fiber, from that guy Magi.

00:00:42.954 --> 00:00:44.074
Where?

00:00:44.684 --> 00:00:46.674
What am I?

00:00:49.524 --> 00:00:56.624
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:00:57.634 --> 00:01:03.504
Zettai Karen Children

00:01:05.944 --> 00:01:11.744
Anata to koushite deaeta no wa

00:01:12.074 --> 00:01:16.944
Tada ikiteiku tame nanka ja nai

00:01:18.214 --> 00:01:23.744
Chiisai na chikai wa toki wo koete

00:01:24.154 --> 00:01:28.754
Mirai wo kanarazu kaeru yo

00:01:29.364 --> 00:01:32.264
Limiter (changing myself)

00:01:32.264 --> 00:01:35.394
Tokihaneteba (changing yourself)

00:01:35.534 --> 00:01:41.274
Hotobashiru tenshi no shining

00:01:42.714 --> 00:01:45.274
Sekai wo sukuu "tsubasa"

00:01:45.274 --> 00:01:48.114
Ima watashi ga eranda michi

00:01:48.344 --> 00:01:54.514
Yume wo tsukamitai dakedo (Tomaranai)

00:01:54.654 --> 00:01:57.454
Ataerareta chikara ga

00:01:57.454 --> 00:02:00.094
Sora e karitateru yo

00:02:00.094 --> 00:02:05.824
Tsuyoku ririshiku habataite

00:02:06.164 --> 00:02:11.694
Zettai karen my wings

00:02:19.684 --> 00:02:20.544
For crying out loud... Major!

00:02:20.544 --> 00:02:21.814
38th sense: "The Butterfly's Dream!
Dream Maker"
For crying out loud... Major!

00:02:21.814 --> 00:02:22.684
38th sense: "The Butterfly's Dream!
Dream Maker"
You're too nice to kids! Why'd you go that far?

00:02:22.684 --> 00:02:25.014
You're too nice to kids! Why'd you go that far?

00:02:25.014 --> 00:02:26.924
You're a mess.

00:02:26.924 --> 00:02:29.324
It's not as bad as it looks.

00:02:29.324 --> 00:02:31.454
Good job on your end, too.

00:02:33.064 --> 00:02:34.824
Mission complete.

00:02:34.824 --> 00:02:38.024
The real president has been politely returned.

00:02:39.664 --> 00:02:41.964
Hey there, Prime Minister.

00:02:41.964 --> 00:02:44.374
W-Welcome to Japan...

00:02:44.374 --> 00:02:47.744
Wouldn't it have been better if we'd
just killed a guy like that?

00:02:47.744 --> 00:02:50.264
I used this chance to get the
president's personal data.

00:02:50.514 --> 00:02:52.584
It might come in handy for a trade someday.

00:02:52.584 --> 00:02:54.314
Women are scary...

00:02:54.314 --> 00:02:56.654
Well, how about playing for the other team?

00:02:56.654 --> 00:02:58.274
Oh, HELL No!

00:02:58.384 --> 00:03:02.694
What's so great about real women?
Right, Moga-chan?

00:03:02.694 --> 00:03:04.124
Moga-chan never uses the toilet!

00:03:04.524 --> 00:03:09.294
But are you sure this is okay?
Didn't Kaoru cause the largest damage?

00:03:09.864 --> 00:03:11.224
That's right.

00:03:11.994 --> 00:03:15.564
She's reached the point where she can
protect us with that great power.

00:03:19.344 --> 00:03:20.534
Although...

00:03:20.604 --> 00:03:22.594
In some ways, I regret it a bit.

00:03:24.214 --> 00:03:25.004
Major?

00:03:25.274 --> 00:03:28.014
C'mon, you know you can't resist me!

00:03:28.014 --> 00:03:29.344
No way!

00:03:37.724 --> 00:03:39.394
Are you all right, Kaoru?

00:03:39.394 --> 00:03:40.394
Where are we?

00:03:40.394 --> 00:03:42.764
The BABEL infirmary. Do you remember?

00:03:42.764 --> 00:03:44.524
You blacked out after the booster was activated.

00:03:45.194 --> 00:03:49.234
Oh... What happened then?!

00:03:49.234 --> 00:03:49.834
HIGH-DENSITY COMPRESSION
GAMMA TREATMENT ROOM

00:03:49.834 --> 00:03:52.474
HIGH-DENSITY COMPRESSION
GAMMA TREATMENT ROOM
Minamoto, the way the
booster functioned before...

00:03:52.474 --> 00:03:54.404
HIGH-DENSITY COMPRESSION
GAMMA TREATMENT ROOM
Right. I'll do everything to figure that out.

00:03:54.944 --> 00:03:59.144
That kind of power will become a threat
to the guys in Black Phantom.

00:03:59.144 --> 00:04:01.774
Next time, they may come after
The Children directly.

00:04:02.244 --> 00:04:04.914
But! It's not just that.

00:04:06.254 --> 00:04:08.524
Anyway, I'll help, too.

00:04:08.524 --> 00:04:12.224
No way I can let Black Phantom
get away with stuff like this!

00:04:12.224 --> 00:04:13.024
Sakaki!

00:04:14.724 --> 00:04:16.464
Kaoru woke up!

00:04:16.464 --> 00:04:18.864
She has? Thank goodness.

00:04:24.004 --> 00:04:25.534
How's he doing?

00:04:25.534 --> 00:04:28.904
Minor injuries. I'm keeping him sedated.

00:04:28.904 --> 00:04:30.964
So, he still doesn't remember anything?

00:04:31.674 --> 00:04:36.514
When his brainwashing was broken, he
also lost his memory and ESP powers.

00:04:37.614 --> 00:04:40.914
His code name's Barret.
There were no other clues.

00:04:41.554 --> 00:04:44.994
He doesn't know who he is now.
Just a Normal with amnesia.

00:04:45.854 --> 00:04:49.234
Because of what we... Of what I did?

00:04:49.234 --> 00:04:52.194
No, I think he was conditioned
that way from the start.

00:04:52.804 --> 00:04:56.464
So that he wouldn't give information or aid to
the enemy if his brainwashing was broken.

00:04:57.034 --> 00:04:59.104
You did great!

00:04:59.104 --> 00:05:01.744
Something that no one could have predicted.

00:05:01.744 --> 00:05:04.314
He owes his life to what you all did.

00:05:04.314 --> 00:05:06.284
Black Phantom may have stolen his past,

00:05:06.284 --> 00:05:07.904
but he hasn't lost his future.

00:05:11.014 --> 00:05:13.654
Thank you. You really did a great job.

00:05:13.654 --> 00:05:15.454
You're the best espers around.

00:05:17.094 --> 00:05:19.054
Minamoto! Gimme a reward kiss!

00:05:19.054 --> 00:05:20.294
Hey, cut it out!

00:05:20.294 --> 00:05:21.964
Hey, no fair! Me, too!

00:05:21.964 --> 00:05:23.634
And me!

00:05:23.634 --> 00:05:24.994
Oh? What's going on?

00:05:24.994 --> 00:05:27.594
Oh, Minamoto! You're finally in the mood?

00:05:27.664 --> 00:05:28.334
Yup!

00:05:28.334 --> 00:05:29.304
Who is?!

00:05:29.304 --> 00:05:31.734
He said we were the best women around!

00:05:31.734 --> 00:05:33.374
No, I didn't!

00:05:33.374 --> 00:05:36.714
Anyway, sorry I was late giving you backup.

00:05:36.714 --> 00:05:40.514
I gave the rescue of the people
attacked by PANDRA priority.

00:05:40.514 --> 00:05:42.954
You were late because you stopped
to put on your makeup!

00:05:42.954 --> 00:05:45.454
Leave it on, the next time you go to sleep!

00:05:45.454 --> 00:05:46.784
Don't be ridiculous!

00:05:46.784 --> 00:05:49.694
What's a middle-aged man know about
the importance of skin care?!

00:05:49.694 --> 00:05:50.914
Easy! Easy!

00:05:52.254 --> 00:05:53.794
More importantly...

00:05:53.794 --> 00:05:55.264
I'm sorry! I'm sorry!

00:05:56.364 --> 00:05:58.194
By the way, Minamoto...

00:06:00.904 --> 00:06:05.434
Figures. I gave you that thing for
exactly this sort of circumstance.

00:06:05.434 --> 00:06:06.774
But, Director!

00:06:07.844 --> 00:06:10.474
You know about the prediction I was shown.

00:06:10.474 --> 00:06:13.184
Don't you know what that thing is?!

00:06:13.184 --> 00:06:15.314
Of course I do.

00:06:15.314 --> 00:06:18.584
Which is all the more reason
you need to carry it.

00:06:19.214 --> 00:06:20.944
Keep it with you. At all times.

00:06:50.984 --> 00:06:52.854
The high output blaster.

00:06:52.854 --> 00:06:55.824
Developed to kill espers who are
normally immune to guns.

00:06:55.824 --> 00:06:57.344
Its other name: "The Esper Hunter".

00:06:58.094 --> 00:07:01.784
Kaoru felt Barret's suffering from
his brainwashing before.

00:07:02.294 --> 00:07:05.124
I have to! Aoi, please!

00:07:05.764 --> 00:07:07.424
Oh, well.

00:07:08.034 --> 00:07:11.174
The way Hyobu and the others call her "queen"...

00:07:11.174 --> 00:07:13.134
It may not simply be a nickname.

00:07:13.974 --> 00:07:17.614
If espers really are the next
step in humanity's evolution,

00:07:17.614 --> 00:07:21.844
and if the impulse to protect
them lies within Kaoru, then...

00:07:22.114 --> 00:07:26.414
You, a Normal, are helping
to give birth to the queen.

00:07:35.364 --> 00:07:38.924
I don't want to just protect their present.
I want to protect their future, as well!

00:07:40.464 --> 00:07:43.434
Hyobu will have his way over my dead body!

00:07:44.434 --> 00:07:49.244
You have your instructions.
Use your powers as much as you like.

00:07:49.244 --> 00:07:50.934
Roger, Boss.

00:08:00.254 --> 00:08:01.984
Don't be so extravagant!

00:08:02.384 --> 00:08:04.854
No way! Onions sting my eyes.

00:08:04.854 --> 00:08:08.124
This isn't a broiler. You should use better meat.

00:08:08.124 --> 00:08:09.494
Don't be so extravagant!

00:08:09.494 --> 00:08:10.894
I'm home!

00:08:10.894 --> 00:08:13.404
I bought the curry base,
powdered cheese, and leeks.

00:08:13.404 --> 00:08:15.764
I also checked the mailbox
while I was downstairs.

00:08:15.764 --> 00:08:19.464
Paycheck. Oh, is that a little raise
I see? And that's a bill...

00:08:19.544 --> 00:08:21.304
Hey! No snooping!

00:08:22.914 --> 00:08:24.614
Mr. Minamoto, this is...

00:08:24.614 --> 00:08:25.904
Huh? What's wrong?

00:08:26.384 --> 00:08:28.004
Something's strange about this letter.

00:08:28.414 --> 00:08:31.614
There's just a photo inside.
And I can't see it clearly.

00:08:32.154 --> 00:08:33.984
I can't sense anything else.

00:08:33.984 --> 00:08:35.854
No return address, huh?

00:08:35.854 --> 00:08:39.814
It'd be hard to scan if this was
mechanically-sent direct mail, so...

00:08:40.124 --> 00:08:42.834
But I have a bad feeling about it!

00:08:42.834 --> 00:08:45.264
How can I not see anything? It's strange!

00:08:48.534 --> 00:08:52.634
Best not to touch it anymore.
Aoi, remove what's inside of it.

00:08:52.634 --> 00:08:53.194
Roger!

00:08:54.674 --> 00:08:56.844
What's with the blurry photo?

00:08:56.844 --> 00:08:58.314
I feel like I've seen it somewhere...

00:09:01.214 --> 00:09:02.544
Mr. Minamoto!

00:09:02.544 --> 00:09:03.644
Minamoto!

00:09:15.524 --> 00:09:16.654
What am I?

00:09:20.864 --> 00:09:21.854
Minamoto!

00:09:25.504 --> 00:09:26.404
Who are?

00:09:27.144 --> 00:09:28.104
Why?

00:09:30.014 --> 00:09:32.344
Sorry for the wait, Minamoto.

00:09:32.884 --> 00:09:35.714
K-Kaoru..?

00:09:37.054 --> 00:09:39.954
What's wrong? Don't you feel well?

00:09:41.624 --> 00:09:43.314
You might be catching a cold.

00:09:47.424 --> 00:09:49.224
Let's hurry home and get you warmed up.

00:09:49.224 --> 00:09:50.854
Yeah, sure.

00:09:55.564 --> 00:09:58.404
Mr. Minamoto! Mr. Minamoto!

00:09:58.934 --> 00:10:02.534
He's out cold. Contact the labs at HQ, now!

00:10:02.914 --> 00:10:03.844
Right!

00:10:03.844 --> 00:10:05.744
M-Minamoto!

00:10:08.844 --> 00:10:10.514
I've got you!

00:10:12.684 --> 00:10:15.814
It's show time.

00:10:18.954 --> 00:10:20.854
Just go "guh-guh-guh," like that.

00:10:24.134 --> 00:10:25.864
Maybe we should use a techno cut...

00:10:29.034 --> 00:10:31.674
I see... He suddenly passed out.

00:10:31.674 --> 00:10:34.574
Who's doing this?
Why would they do this to Minamoto?!

00:10:35.104 --> 00:10:38.734
In any case, the enemy is using
this photo for something.

00:10:39.174 --> 00:10:40.444
That's for certain.

00:10:41.384 --> 00:10:42.604
Any ideas?

00:10:43.014 --> 00:10:44.344
Um... No.

00:10:45.154 --> 00:10:46.954
You three, remain on standby.

00:10:46.954 --> 00:10:48.544
We'll contact you as soon as we learn anything.

00:10:48.654 --> 00:10:50.144
LOW FREQUENCY WAVE
SPECIAL ALPHA EXAMINATION ROOM

00:10:52.824 --> 00:10:54.524
Dr. Sakaki, how's Minamoto?

00:10:56.934 --> 00:10:58.064
Mr. Minamoto...

00:10:58.064 --> 00:10:59.564
It's almost like...

00:10:59.564 --> 00:11:00.554
He's enjoying it.

00:11:00.864 --> 00:11:03.674
It's always like this when he
initially enters REM sleep.

00:11:03.674 --> 00:11:08.674
The A-10 nerves get stimulated.
In short, he has a pleasant dream.

00:11:08.674 --> 00:11:10.474
But, after 10 minutes, without fail...

00:11:11.874 --> 00:11:14.434
It turns into a nightmare.
And the cycle keeps repeating.

00:11:14.914 --> 00:11:17.014
What sort of dream is it?

00:11:17.014 --> 00:11:19.114
I don't know.

00:11:23.524 --> 00:11:27.024
There's a strange wall when
we try to enter his mind.

00:11:27.024 --> 00:11:30.154
Architecture. The structure of his mental world.

00:11:30.794 --> 00:11:34.594
But there are gaps in it, here and there.
You think you can break in?

00:11:36.234 --> 00:11:39.644
I think this is memory protection that
was set up by Grandpa Igo.

00:11:39.644 --> 00:11:43.094
Using a surrounding form to close off
a person's mind... It's unnatural.

00:11:43.644 --> 00:11:48.414
No good. I think the enemy is using
Mr. Minamoto's deep psyche to create this.

00:11:48.414 --> 00:11:50.054
A telepath's behind this, huh?

00:11:50.054 --> 00:11:52.414
But I'm not picking up any
external psychic waves.

00:11:54.224 --> 00:11:55.854
What on Earth is going on...

00:11:55.854 --> 00:11:56.684
...in his mind?

00:11:57.124 --> 00:11:57.884
Minamoto.

00:12:03.664 --> 00:12:05.324
Hey! Use your hands!

00:12:06.634 --> 00:12:07.864
No way!

00:12:07.864 --> 00:12:09.264
My hands are full right now.

00:12:09.834 --> 00:12:13.964
You're too spoiled, Kaoru.
You aren't a little kid anymore.

00:12:16.914 --> 00:12:17.894
That's right.

00:12:22.944 --> 00:12:26.784
When I was little, all I wanted was to grow up.

00:12:27.324 --> 00:12:30.014
Now I want to go back to that time.

00:12:31.254 --> 00:12:32.244
Funny, huh?

00:12:33.264 --> 00:12:34.224
Kaoru...

00:12:34.824 --> 00:12:38.524
I really should be going.

00:12:38.994 --> 00:12:41.564
Don't go! I know everything!

00:12:41.564 --> 00:12:44.624
The battle's about to start, right?
You don't have to do this!

00:12:45.234 --> 00:12:48.634
I'm sorry, Minamoto, but!

00:12:52.174 --> 00:12:54.844
At this range, you'll definitely kill me.

00:12:54.844 --> 00:12:55.974
Shoot, Minamoto.

00:12:56.884 --> 00:12:59.614
But even if I'm gone, nothing will change.

00:13:00.454 --> 00:13:02.384
An army of other espers will...

00:13:02.384 --> 00:13:04.494
Dammit, it's happening again!

00:13:04.494 --> 00:13:06.044
Then stop them!

00:13:06.464 --> 00:13:09.254
I've replayed this scene over and over.

00:13:10.194 --> 00:13:13.294
I absolutely don't want to use this thing, but!

00:13:13.934 --> 00:13:15.404
Did you know, Minamoto? I...

00:13:15.404 --> 00:13:16.804
Kaoru, don't! The next thing that happens is!
Did you know, Minamoto? I...

00:13:16.804 --> 00:13:18.704
Kaoru, don't! The next thing that happens is!

00:13:22.904 --> 00:13:24.434
Kaoru, don't!

00:13:37.954 --> 00:13:38.654
Minamoto.

00:13:40.424 --> 00:13:43.024
Heads up, everyone! Prepare to move out!

00:13:43.534 --> 00:13:45.794
We have a positive ID on the enemy esper.

00:13:45.794 --> 00:13:48.354
Their identity? Is it someone
from Black Phantom?

00:13:48.434 --> 00:13:50.504
No, it's not them.

00:13:50.504 --> 00:13:52.524
I brought someone to help!

00:13:53.034 --> 00:13:54.504
Hi there!

00:13:54.504 --> 00:13:55.234
You're!

00:13:55.604 --> 00:13:57.114
You'll get the details in the command center.

00:13:57.114 --> 00:14:00.404
It's high time we awoke our
beloved princess, isn't it?

00:14:01.484 --> 00:14:02.344
Yes!

00:14:02.344 --> 00:14:04.474
Releasing The Children!

00:14:08.084 --> 00:14:09.954
If we should meet in a dream...

00:14:09.954 --> 00:14:11.894
how wonderful it would be.

00:14:11.894 --> 00:14:15.124
But don't you dare stay asleep
when you meet us, either!

00:14:15.124 --> 00:14:17.364
So wake up already, Minamoto!

00:14:17.364 --> 00:14:20.064
The Absolutely Lovely Children!

00:14:33.344 --> 00:14:34.744
That son of a!

00:14:35.014 --> 00:14:38.044
What's he doing, walking around, totally fine?!

00:14:38.714 --> 00:14:43.174
Oh, Minamoto... Tell me that you love me.

00:14:43.294 --> 00:14:44.994
What? This is kind of sudden!

00:14:44.994 --> 00:14:46.754
Go on!

00:14:51.234 --> 00:14:52.594
Chief!

00:14:52.594 --> 00:14:54.594
And Fujiko Tsubomi.

00:14:54.904 --> 00:14:57.064
It's been a while, Kuromaki.

00:14:58.874 --> 00:15:00.504
You're a cool customer, I see.

00:15:00.504 --> 00:15:02.774
You've never seen me before,
yet not even a flinch.

00:15:02.774 --> 00:15:04.474
Good intelligence network.

00:15:05.744 --> 00:15:07.074
So, what's the scam?

00:15:11.114 --> 00:15:12.314
Thank goodness.

00:15:12.314 --> 00:15:15.824
I was nervous about syncing my
thought waves with you, but...

00:15:15.824 --> 00:15:17.154
Thank you.

00:15:17.424 --> 00:15:20.584
You really helped to expand the
effective range of my Hypno power.

00:15:22.324 --> 00:15:24.834
We knew you get your kicks out of

00:15:24.834 --> 00:15:27.734
watching people who are under
your power's influence.

00:15:27.734 --> 00:15:31.224
There's no way out! Now come back with
us and get Minamoto back to normal!

00:15:33.774 --> 00:15:36.244
When you ask people to do stuff for you,

00:15:36.304 --> 00:15:38.374
you kneel down and say "We beg of you!"

00:15:38.374 --> 00:15:39.314
Brats!

00:15:39.314 --> 00:15:40.444
Why, you... PSYCHIC...

00:15:40.444 --> 00:15:41.584
BIG MAGNUM!
Why, you... PSYCHIC...

00:15:41.584 --> 00:15:42.044
BIG MAGNUM!

00:15:43.514 --> 00:15:46.884
Muscle! Then PANDRA really is behind
what happened to Minamoto?

00:15:47.284 --> 00:15:50.094
Mackie! I'm your backup!

00:15:50.094 --> 00:15:52.184
BIG MAGNUM!

00:15:52.594 --> 00:15:54.454
Thank you, Kama!

00:15:56.664 --> 00:15:57.654
Running away?!

00:15:59.664 --> 00:16:00.324
Kaoru!

00:16:00.864 --> 00:16:02.764
You get to fight us!

00:16:03.164 --> 00:16:04.734
Who cares if you're the queen?

00:16:04.734 --> 00:16:06.504
To follow the major's orders...

00:16:06.504 --> 00:16:08.094
I'll split into three servants!

00:16:08.604 --> 00:16:10.404
We are the Tsundere Queens!

00:16:10.674 --> 00:16:12.214
The Mio-Dren!

00:16:12.214 --> 00:16:13.374
Yeah!

00:16:13.684 --> 00:16:17.484
Great. Because nothing ticks us off
like other people mocking us.

00:16:17.484 --> 00:16:19.114
We don't have time to play with you!

00:16:19.414 --> 00:16:21.584
Magnum! Magnum! Magnum! Magnum!

00:16:21.984 --> 00:16:24.054
So, you're the notorious gay guy, huh?

00:16:24.054 --> 00:16:25.824
Your power's annoying, I'll grant you...

00:16:26.154 --> 00:16:28.754
BIG MAGNUM!

00:16:31.234 --> 00:16:33.894
But it's pointless if you can't hit me!

00:16:34.234 --> 00:16:36.824
This is getting to be a running joke...

00:16:38.134 --> 00:16:41.074
I hate guys who just worry about
how big and thick they are.

00:16:44.874 --> 00:16:47.074
Great! Why do you always, always?!

00:16:49.984 --> 00:16:51.784
Till next time!

00:16:52.654 --> 00:16:54.224
We have to get after her!

00:16:54.224 --> 00:16:54.704
Right!

00:16:59.594 --> 00:17:00.884
Hold it!

00:17:06.904 --> 00:17:08.864
Sleepy...

00:17:09.664 --> 00:17:10.794
Granny!

00:17:15.544 --> 00:17:16.804
Why, you!

00:17:18.644 --> 00:17:20.544
That car is equipped with ECM!

00:17:20.784 --> 00:17:22.644
DARN IT!

00:17:25.414 --> 00:17:26.614
Ms. Tokiwa, if you'd be so kind!

00:17:28.954 --> 00:17:32.994
There! The fugitives are headed
north on Ganmo Street!

00:17:32.994 --> 00:17:34.364
Head them off, please!

00:17:34.364 --> 00:17:34.914
Roger!

00:17:42.564 --> 00:17:44.234
BABEL 1, pursuing target!

00:17:44.234 --> 00:17:46.004
Capture at once!

00:17:57.514 --> 00:17:58.644
Freeze!

00:17:59.814 --> 00:18:00.914
We've been tricked!

00:18:03.794 --> 00:18:08.124
Setsuko Kuromaki. Age: 19.
Former special esper trainee.

00:18:08.124 --> 00:18:10.434
A telepathy-based multi-power user.

00:18:10.434 --> 00:18:12.764
In short, a former upperclassman of yours.

00:18:12.764 --> 00:18:15.704
She went missing a few years ago, but...

00:18:16.564 --> 00:18:20.004
I want to use my power to do what I like!

00:18:20.004 --> 00:18:21.634
Working for BABEL is just a major bore.

00:18:22.444 --> 00:18:24.674
I never thought she'd join Hyobu.

00:18:24.744 --> 00:18:26.674
So, what's her power, then?

00:18:27.084 --> 00:18:29.114
Her code name is Dream Maker.

00:18:29.114 --> 00:18:32.054
As it implies, she has the power to
manipulate the dreams of others.

00:18:33.054 --> 00:18:37.794
In her case, you could say she creates
a world within a mental world.

00:18:37.794 --> 00:18:39.854
Creates a world? Then!

00:18:40.364 --> 00:18:41.484
Hang on.

00:18:46.764 --> 00:18:47.394
Thought so.

00:18:47.734 --> 00:18:50.134
The human brain has a huge
capacity for calculation

00:18:50.134 --> 00:18:51.874
that's removed from its consciousness.

00:18:51.874 --> 00:18:55.104
Kuromaki uses that to create
a kind of virtual reality.

00:18:55.504 --> 00:19:00.244
In short, she implants a repeating dream
program into another person's brain.

00:19:00.244 --> 00:19:02.214
I get it. So, this photo is...

00:19:02.484 --> 00:19:06.074
While the actual image is unclear,
Kuromaki made it using her powers!

00:19:06.354 --> 00:19:11.154
Meaning she's transmitting the dream she
made into Minamoto through the photo?

00:19:11.154 --> 00:19:13.294
But why just Mr. Minamoto?

00:19:13.294 --> 00:19:14.954
We all looked at the same thing.

00:19:15.924 --> 00:19:19.384
Minamoto... What could you be dreaming about?

00:19:27.904 --> 00:19:29.104
Kaoru!

00:19:29.344 --> 00:19:31.474
Rise! Bow!

00:19:31.474 --> 00:19:33.074
Goodbye!

00:19:33.484 --> 00:19:36.084
Hey, you three! Let's stop off on the way home!

00:19:36.084 --> 00:19:38.384
We found a really fun store!

00:19:38.384 --> 00:19:41.184
We heard they sell super-rare
Crab King cards there!

00:19:41.184 --> 00:19:42.684
You should come with us, if it's all right.

00:19:42.684 --> 00:19:44.584
No. Sorry, but we're...

00:19:45.054 --> 00:19:47.184
Maybe another time. Thanks!

00:19:50.564 --> 00:19:51.734
Oh...

00:19:51.734 --> 00:19:53.164
Well, see you tomorrow.

00:19:54.464 --> 00:19:56.304
Sure. See you.

00:19:56.304 --> 00:19:56.924
Bye-bye.

00:19:57.534 --> 00:20:00.544
They've been really down lately.

00:20:00.544 --> 00:20:02.134
I wonder if something happened.

00:20:03.344 --> 00:20:05.204
It's been three days now.

00:20:05.814 --> 00:20:08.044
Granny Tsubomi hasn't woken up, either.

00:20:08.144 --> 00:20:09.704
LOW FREQUENCY WAVE
SPECIAL ALPHA EXAMINATION ROOM

00:20:10.514 --> 00:20:12.284
No change with Mr. Minamoto.

00:20:14.054 --> 00:20:17.624
The nightmare again. The cycle's getting shorter.

00:20:17.624 --> 00:20:19.154
It's like Kaoru when she's watching TV

00:20:19.154 --> 00:20:22.024
and a news bulletin breaks into a love
scene, just as it's getting good.

00:20:22.594 --> 00:20:25.464
An accurate, though roundabout example.

00:20:25.464 --> 00:20:27.664
Why don't you try to think of
something more useful?

00:20:28.564 --> 00:20:29.964
How dare you talk that way to me!

00:20:29.964 --> 00:20:33.544
You're not much help here, either,
Miss Psychometrist!

00:20:33.544 --> 00:20:35.374
Are you saying this is my fault?!

00:20:35.374 --> 00:20:37.174
Stop that, you two!

00:20:37.174 --> 00:20:41.344
We're all equally worried.
No point losing your heads, right?

00:20:41.344 --> 00:20:43.814
Everyone's doing everything
they can to track down Kuromaki.

00:20:44.584 --> 00:20:46.954
We have to wait till we find a clue.

00:20:46.954 --> 00:20:49.514
Minamoto's trying his best, too.

00:20:50.724 --> 00:20:51.484
I'm sorry.

00:20:51.854 --> 00:20:53.984
Yeah. Me, too.

00:20:56.264 --> 00:20:57.554
By the way, where's Kaoru?

00:21:02.934 --> 00:21:04.694
Cheer up, Queen.

00:21:05.334 --> 00:21:09.434
When I see you so sad, I don't know what to do.

00:21:09.504 --> 00:21:11.704
Mr. Hyobu! Why'd you do that to Minamoto?!

00:21:12.174 --> 00:21:15.244
He's my enemy, in several meanings.

00:21:15.244 --> 00:21:18.584
But I don't want to see you looking so sad.

00:21:21.924 --> 00:21:24.214
Please, wake Minamoto up.

00:21:26.524 --> 00:21:30.534
Minamoto, who's always yelling
at us and complaining...

00:21:30.534 --> 00:21:33.824
Now I look at him... Just lying there,
with his eyes closed...

00:21:33.904 --> 00:21:36.104
And I!

00:21:36.104 --> 00:21:39.364
I can deflect a missile, but...

00:21:39.634 --> 00:21:41.364
With all my power, I can't do anything!

00:21:42.544 --> 00:21:46.774
That dream was based on a prediction,
to find a possibility for the future.

00:21:46.774 --> 00:21:49.114
It was made to find a way out.

00:21:51.784 --> 00:21:55.374
Leave BABEL and join me, Queen.

00:21:56.154 --> 00:21:56.954
Mr. Hyobu...

00:21:57.494 --> 00:22:01.924
In the dream or in reality, that's the only way out.

00:22:21.384 --> 00:22:26.114
Kimi no tsuyogari wo gyuuto dakishimeta

00:22:26.114 --> 00:22:29.084
Setsunai yokogao sae zenbu

00:22:29.084 --> 00:22:31.454
I-TO-SHI-I

00:22:31.454 --> 00:22:35.624
Kabe wo kowasu tabi tsuyokunaru hito yo

00:22:35.624 --> 00:22:41.534
Boku no hitomi ni kurui wa nai

00:22:41.804 --> 00:22:46.834
Massugu sugiru mune no omoi

00:22:46.834 --> 00:22:50.344
Darenimo makenai kara

00:22:50.344 --> 00:22:55.644
Zettai kimi wo hanasanai donna toki mo

00:22:55.644 --> 00:23:00.824
Mada mienai LAST wa boku ga kaeyou

00:23:00.824 --> 00:23:05.154
Akuma mo tenshi nimo tsubasa ga aru

00:23:05.154 --> 00:23:10.794
Motto takai sora e to michibikou

00:23:10.794 --> 00:23:15.504
Kore ijou egao wo kumorasenai

00:23:15.504 --> 00:23:21.874
Tsunagaru kibou ga ima yami wo hikisaitara

00:23:21.874 --> 00:23:24.804
Kimi to tomo ni

00:23:25.044 --> 00:23:30.674
Tobikoeru ashita e Break Your Destiny

00:23:39.954 --> 00:23:40.824
BEWARE OF FLYING SQUIRRELS!

00:23:40.824 --> 00:23:41.024
BEWARE OF FLYING SQUIRRELS!
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.024 --> 00:23:41.964
NEXT EPISODE
BEWARE OF FLYING SQUIRRELS!
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:41.964 --> 00:23:42.694
Next time, on Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:42.694 --> 00:23:44.664
Don't move, Queen Of Catastrophe!

00:23:44.664 --> 00:23:45.594
No... Kaoru!

00:23:45.864 --> 00:23:48.464
Wh-What is this? Why are Minamoto and I?

00:23:48.464 --> 00:23:50.674
Kaoru! Don't get caught up in the program!

00:23:50.674 --> 00:23:51.534
It's a dream!

00:23:51.534 --> 00:23:52.174
A dream?

00:23:52.174 --> 00:23:54.674
If Kaoru's and Mr. Minamoto's
minds synchronize,

00:23:54.674 --> 00:23:56.604
I might be able to pull them out of the dream!

00:23:56.604 --> 00:23:58.074
Zettai Karen Children!

00:23:58.074 --> 00:24:00.914
Episode 39. "Impermanent Existence!
Psycho-Divers!"

00:24:00.914 --> 00:24:02.044
Don't flatter yourself.

00:24:02.044 --> 00:24:03.914
In the end, I'll be the one
who changes the future.

00:24:03.914 --> 00:24:06.614
And I swear that I'll protect Kaoru!

00:24:06.614 --> 00:24:06.684
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:06.684 --> 00:24:08.584
Impermanent Existence!
Psycho-Divers
We're absolutely lovely, so we never lose!

00:24:08.584 --> 00:24:09.954
Impermanent Existence!
Psycho-Divers
